g scale of his decades-long spree, highlighting his ability to blend in and evade capture, a disturbing paradox that continues to fascinate and alarm.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/americas-most-feared-serial-killer-the-story-of-ted-bundy-who-studied-psychology-and-law-before-murdering-more-than-30-women/articleshow/129961944.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/americas-most-feared-serial-killer-the-story-of-ted-bundy-who-studied-psychology-and-law-before-murdering-more-than-30-women/articleshow/129961944.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-02T03:03:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129961997,imgsize-554656.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[IShowSpeed quits YouTube, fans left speechless by the real reason]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129961903.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Internet sensation IShowSpeed sparked concern with a YouTube exit announcement. Fans feared losing their favorite streamer. However, the news was a playful April Fools' Day prank. IShowSpeed confirmed he is not leaving the platform. Viewers expressed relief and anticipation for more content. The incident highlighted the fun of online humor.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-quits-youtube-fans-left-speechless-by-the-real-reason/articleshow/129961903.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-quits-youtube-fans-left-speechless-by-the-real-reason/articleshow/129961903.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-02T02:30:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/phot