558.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Buried for 2,500 years: giant lost structure discovered beneath Egypt’s Nile Delta]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129957192.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/buried-for-2500-years-giant-lost-structure-discovered-beneath-egypts-nile-delta/articleshow/129957192.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/buried-for-2500-years-giant-lost-structure-discovered-beneath-egypts-nile-delta/articleshow/129957192.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-01T21:47:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129957198,imgsize-114148.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: Syrian President struggles to open water bottle during UK event as female host helps, video goes viral]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129957346.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/watch-syrian-president-struggles-to-open-water-bottle-during-uk-event-as-female-host-helps-video-goes-viral/articleshow/129957346.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/watch-syrian-president-struggles-to-open-water-bottle-during-uk-event-as-female-host-helps-video-goes-viral/articleshow/129957346.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-01T21:54:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129957346,imgsize-84066.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Redditor devastated after losing last chance at H-1B lottery, gets trolled for 'galling entitlement']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129956844.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/redditor-devastated-after-losing-last-chance-at-h-1b-lottery-gets-trolled-for-galling-entitlement/articleshow/129956844.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/redditor-devastated-after-losing-last-chance-at-h-1b-lottery-gets-trolled-for-galling-entitlement/articleshow/129956844.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-01T21:35:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129956897,imgsize-118446.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[10 ‘superpowers’ women possess that are biologically impossible for men]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129950648.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The woman's body is often thought of as simply an average body. However, the more we learn about evolutionary biology, the more we understand that the women’s genome has been specifically adapted for a different form of highly efficient survival. From how the brain interprets sensory information all the way down to having two sets of immune system genes on its X chromosome (which accounts for the fact that females, on average, have a higher immunity to disease than males), a great number of characteristics that make females biologically unique do not get recognised. Here are some examples of physiological accomplishments performed by women with much greater levels of efficiency than men.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/10-superpowers-women-possess-that-are-biologically-impossible-for-men/photostory/129950648.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/10-superpowers-women-possess-that-are-biologically-impossible-for-men/photostory/129950648.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-02T03:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129950648,imgsize-92308.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[The war that broke Greece: How Athens and Sparta destroyed their own world]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129949995.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/the-war-that-broke-greece-how-athens-and-sparta-destroyed-their-own-world/articleshow/129949995.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/the-war-that-broke-greece-how-athens-and-sparta-destroyed-their-own-world/articleshow/129949995.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-02T07:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129950802,imgsize-64132.cms"/></item></channel></rss>